MIDI Tests Directory [ tests/midi ] for the rtl66 library
Chris Ahlstrom
2022-06-04 to 2025-09-13

This directory is where all test products for MIDI will reside.
See build/README for more information.

Basic rtl66 tests:

    tests/midi/api_names.cpp
    tests/midi/cbmidiin.cpp
    tests/midi/midiclock.cpp
    tests/midi/midiout.cpp
    tests/midi/midiprobe.cpp
    tests/midi/midiprobeex.cpp
    tests/midi/qmidiin.cpp
    tests/midi/smoke.cpp
    tests/midi/sysextest.cpp
    tests/midi/test_c_api.c

Advanced masterbus paradigm tests:

    tests/midi/busout.cpp
    tests/midi/play.cpp

